These model checkpoints are derivative works of credentialed intensive-care
datasets (MIMIC-IV, eICU-CRD, and HiRID via PhysioNet; SICdb). They are released
for non-commercial academic research only, under the following terms:

1. Eligibility. You must already hold the relevant credentialed-access approvals
   for the source datasets (PhysioNet credentialing for MIMIC-IV/eICU/HiRID; SICdb
   access) and remain bound by those data-use agreements.
2. Permitted use. Reproduction and verification of the accompanying manuscript and
   non-commercial methodological research on multi-institutional EHR modeling.
3. Prohibited use. Redistribution of the weights; any attempt to re-identify
   individuals; clinical or diagnostic deployment; commercial use; and any use that
   violates the source datasets' data-use agreements.
4. No warranty. Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. This is a research
   artifact and is not a medical device.

Access is granted on a per-application basis at the authors' discretion.
